</p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2" style="">*A Complimentary Invitation is
a single-entry invitation to access an Eligible Lounge, issued at Qantas'
absolute and sole discretion to Eligible Customers. Eligible Customers are
customers who have received a complimentary invitation directly from Qantas. Invitations
must be linked to an Eligible Flight at least 24 hours before day of departure
to ensure lounge access. Depending on the invitation type, Eligible Customers
may be able to access a domestic Qantas Club, Qantas International Lounge, or
Qantas operated International Business Lounge (excluding Los Angeles Tom
Bradley Terminal) when travelling onward that day on a Qantas (QF) or Jetstar
(JQ, 3K, GK, BL) flight number. Lounge Access is subject to the terms and
conditions of that lounge. Lounge Access is subject to space availability and
Eligible Customers may be refused entry if the lounge is full. Smart, casual
dress standards apply. Complimentary Invitations cannot be resold and any
invitations in breach of this policy will be cancelled and may disqualify the
original invitation holder from receiving future invitations. For full terms
and conditions, refer to <span class="MsoHyperlink" style=""><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/the-qantas-club/complimentary-invitations.html">Complimentary
Lounge Invitations</a></span> on qantas.com.&nbsp;<font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;"><o:p></o:p></font></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2" style=""><br></font></span></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="line-height: 107%;"></span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>

